<h2>8. Backups and data loss</h2><p>Data stored only on a device may be lost if the device is damaged or lost, the App is uninstalled or app data is cleared. We recommend synchronization and regular exports. To the extent permitted by law, we are not responsible for loss arising from failure to back up, deletion by you or an authorized user, device/network failure or third-party provider incidents outside our reasonable control. This section does not exclude mandatory liability under applicable law.</p>
<h2>9. Prohibited conduct</h2><ul><li>Using the App unlawfully or storing/sharing content that infringes another person's rights.</li><li>Interfering with, probing, bypassing security or limits, exploiting vulnerabilities or accessing data without authorization.</li><li>Sending spam or bulk invitations, or disrupting the system or other users.</li><li>Modifying the App to bypass payment or unlock Pro without authorization; copying, reverse engineering or reselling unlawfully, except where permitted by law or an open-source license.</li></ul>
